Amvia UK Connectivity Data — published feeds
Licence terms, by feed

This repository is licensed in two tiers. The tier that applies to a given
file is stated in that file's own `terms` field, and in the `terms` map in
the `manifest.json` alongside it. Those machine-readable values are
authoritative; this document explains them.

================================================================================
TIER 1 — HEADLINE FEEDS: Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International
         (CC-BY-4.0)

Applies to files whose `terms` field reads exactly:

    CC-BY-4.0

Currently: delivery_lag, contract_status, ecc_pooled.

You are free to share and adapt this material for any purpose, including
commercially, provided you give appropriate credit, link to the licence,
and indicate if changes were made.

Required attribution text:

    Source: Amvia UK Connectivity Data

Full licence: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
Legal code:   https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode

Requested, but not a condition of the licence: cite a pinned commit URL
rather than a branch URL, so the figures you quote remain the figures a
reader retrieves.

================================================================================
TIER 2 — GRANULAR FEEDS: All rights reserved

Applies to files whose `terms` field reads exactly:

    all-rights-reserved-contact-for-licence

Currently: benchmark_cells, regional_medians.

These files are published for inspection and evaluation. No licence to
copy, redistribute, or create derivative works is granted by their presence
in a public repository. For commercial or redistribution licensing, open an
issue on this repository.

