are not a market index, not investment advice, and not a substitute for a
quotation. In no event shall the authors or copyright holders be liable for
any claim, damages or other liability arising from, out of or in connection
with these files or their use.

Each figure's population, measurement basis and sample size are stated in
the data. Read them before relying on a number: a statistic is only as
general as the population beneath it.
